;; The sim race (simrace.yml, clojure -M:simrace): runners that play the whole bot in the race's
;; captured worlds against the server model, on every core, from every landing with seed after
;; seed until the budget is spent. The real-server race (ci/race.edn) has the other runners.
{:simrace/runners 8                  ; GitHub runners, each a share of the worlds; the real race has eight, four stay free
 :simrace/sets ["R1" "R2" "R3" "R4"] ; the race's landing sets (ci/gym.edn), captured by simworld.yml
 :simrace/until "nether"             ; the target each run plays every step up to
 :simrace/max-minutes 90             ; simulated minutes a run may take
 :simrace/budget-minutes 330         ; wall minutes a runner plays: 300 took 303 with setup (sim race 38515210080), inside the job's 355 of GitHub's 360
 :simrace/heap-mb 12288}                ; the runner's 16 GB, less the system's share
